 business and way number  seven is model success whenever you  don't know what to do whenever you don't  know how an industry works the best  thing you can do is model success find  people who have done that thing whatever  your side hustle is find somebody who  has done it and they're doing it  full-time and they're doing it with a  team and they're doing it with a huge  empire that now they've built up from  scratch whatever you are doing somebody  has done it in a big way it may not be  exactly what you're doing but they've  done it in a different industry or a  slightly different industry in a big way  for me it was modeling Bill Gates I had  a biotech software company there was no  big biotech software company that I  could model when I was starting mine and  so I looked to Microsoft which is  another kind of software company and how  did Bill Gates get started zero to one  story that's what I wanted to do for my  own business and so looking at that  other software company taught me lessons  and Bill Gates saved my first company I  would have gone out of business without  learning from Bill Gates's story and so  whatever problem you're facing right now  somebody has already solved it and going  back looking at their story retracing  the roots and applying those lessons to  your situation can really dramatically  explode your growth so those are my  seven ways on how to improve your side  hustle I'd love to know from you which  one was your favorite which one you're  going to apply immediately into your  business did I miss an eight nine ten  that you want to add to the list leave  in the comments below I look forward to  hearing from you thank you guys so much  for watching I believe in you I hope you  continue to believe in yourself and  whatever your one where it is  much love I'll see you soon if you had  to think of one word that's most  important to you or that sums you Apple  that would be like a little beacon pay  believe nation if you want to know what 